00:18:51,280 --> 00:21:27,840
Re-reading the chapters adapted in this episode broke my heart, the adaptation doesn't do it justice.
In the novel, Wang Lin never tells Zhou Ru about Li Muwan, she understands by herself. She even says "Wan'er" without having ever heard the name. Wang Lin doesn't negociate with her to have her transfer her soul to another body but with Wan'er to make her accept the fact she's highjacking a child's body, which is why Wan'er says Wang Lin lied at the end of the episode.
Most of the interaction between them in this episode is donghua original.
“Uncle, little Ru'er is a monster…”
“Uncle, I can feel that the little person in my body is like… like the big sister in my dream. She is that little person. Uncle, little Ru'er is scared. Can you take her out…”
“Uncle, little Ru'er is scared. Can you quickly take her out, please ?”
“Little Ru'er, don’t be scared. Just pretend that the little person inside you is your big sister. Don’t worry.”
“Really? Uncle isn’t lying to me?”
“Really…”
“Uncle, little Ru'er is already 13 years old. There are some things I already understand. You are different from Grandpa Tie Yan. When you look at me, you aren’t looking at me but at the little person inside me. Grandpa Tie Yan wasn’t the same. What he looked at was me…”
“I know that when you saved me from that bad cultivator, it wasn’t for me but for the big sister inside me…”
“The big sister I saw in my dreams is very pretty, but I believe that when I grow up, I’ll be even prettier, so Uncle, don’t leave me…”
“Uncle, can you tell little Ru'er stories of you and big sister?”
“Uncle, if I die early, does that mean big sister Wan'er won’t be able to wake up…”
“Uncle, in your eyes, is little Ru'er only a body for big sister Wan'er to wake up in ?”
“Uncle doesn’t want me anymore. Little White, you also left…”

285
00:19:08,780 --> 00:19:12,080
To let go of the consequences of my actions

286
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:13,800
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

287
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:15,740
like scattered ink.

288
00:19:16,620 --> 00:19:23,220
As destiny falls

289
00:19:19,460 --> 00:19:23,220
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

290
00:19:23,220 --> 00:19:30,820
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

291
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:30,820
wither and melt into rivers.

292
00:19:31,260 --> 00:19:38,380
Who can deceive

293
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:38,380
the law of the heavens ?

294
00:19:38,700 --> 00:19:41,700
Countless generations

295
00:19:39,980 --> 00:19:41,700
have tried before me.

296
00:19:41,990 --> 00:19:45,420
But how could I not catch my dreams

297
00:19:43,820 --> 00:19:45,420
within my warm fingers ?

298
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:49,500
You're at my side when I'm alone

299
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:52,820
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

300
00:19:53,580 --> 00:19:56,780
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

301
00:19:57,140 --> 00:20:00,980
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

302
00:19:58,980 --> 00:20:00,980
in the streets.

303
00:20:01,140 --> 00:20:05,940
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

304
00:20:02,700 --> 00:20:05,940
Can I break the rules ?

305
00:20:05,950 --> 00:20:08,660
To run towards you !

306
00:20:08,700 --> 00:20:11,980
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

307
00:20:11,980 --> 00:20:16,620
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

308
00:20:16,620 --> 00:20:20,020
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

309
00:20:20,060 --> 00:20:24,700
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

310
00:20:25,150 --> 00:20:30,380
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

311
00:20:30,500 --> 00:20:34,300
If your soul is willing to wander,

312
00:20:34,300 --> 00:20:38,940
can I still take your hands

313
00:20:35,980 --> 00:20:38,940
and hold them tight ?

314
00:20:39,100 --> 00:20:42,020
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

315
00:20:42,020 --> 00:20:46,900
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

316
00:20:46,910 --> 00:20:50,180
I dream of destroying

317
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:54,900
the shackles of our fate.

318
00:20:54,900 --> 00:20:58,860
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

319
00:20:58,860 --> 00:21:01,660
You're the hardest to let go of.

320
00:21:01,740 --> 00:21:05,540
I want to be with you again

321
00:21:05,620 --> 00:21:08,900
so I can look in your eyes.

322
00:21:09,180 --> 00:21:14,140
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
